WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.450 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 20]

01:38.150 --> 01:39.000
Zhen?

01:40.640 --> 01:41.509
Zhengshen?

01:42.680 --> 01:44.280
Why are you here in Suzhou?

01:44.400 --> 01:45.560
If we didn't come to Suzhou,

01:45.560 --> 01:48.490
how would we know
that the Li family had a "Lord Wang"?

01:49.400 --> 01:50.479
Take her away.

01:50.950 --> 01:52.479
Master, what's happening?

01:53.000 --> 01:54.039
How dare you!

01:54.710 --> 01:56.840
Do you have any respect for your elder?

01:56.840 --> 01:58.350
I am your uncle.

01:58.870 --> 02:01.280
If your Aunt Chunhua finds out,

02:01.400 --> 02:02.710
she won't spare you guys!

02:02.710 --> 02:03.360
Bah!

02:04.200 --> 02:05.950
How dare you bring up Aunt Chunhua?

02:05.950 --> 02:06.840
Li Decai,

02:07.000 --> 02:09.120
you totally live off
the Li family's support,

02:09.120 --> 02:11.800
yet you are so ungrateful,
reselling raw lacquer secretly.

02:11.800 --> 02:13.750
To cover for you, Aunt Chunhua

02:14.000 --> 02:15.770
cooked the books
behind the Li family's back.

02:15.770 --> 02:16.829
And what did you do?

02:17.190 --> 02:19.800
You used this money to keep a mistress?

02:20.310 --> 02:22.770
Don't you feel guilty
towards Aunt Chunhua?

02:23.470 --> 02:25.930
The raw lacquer
belongs to our Sixth Branch.

02:26.079 --> 02:27.470
I am one of the Sixth Branch, too.

02:27.470 --> 02:28.560
Why can't I sell it?

02:28.710 --> 02:29.680
Besides,

02:29.680 --> 02:33.280
it's just natural for men to have
multiple wives and concubines!

02:46.000 --> 02:46.840
Look up!

02:47.680 --> 02:48.710
Li Decai,

02:49.000 --> 02:50.750
do you think Aunt Chunhua

02:51.030 --> 02:53.360
will bear with you forever for Run's sake?

02:53.840 --> 02:55.190
Or do you think

02:55.280 --> 02:58.079
I don't have evidence
of your illicit dealings in raw lacquer?

02:58.079 --> 02:58.910
Listen,

02:59.030 --> 03:00.120
someone like you

03:00.150 --> 03:01.810
should have his hands broken,

03:02.030 --> 03:03.470
be kicked out of the Li family,

03:03.470 --> 03:05.590
and be sent to the government
to be dealt with!

03:05.590 --> 03:06.650
When that happens,

03:06.920 --> 03:08.510
if Aunt Chunhua leaves you,

03:08.750 --> 03:10.910
the Literary Association
will make your crimes public.

03:10.910 --> 03:13.310
Who in the ink industry in Suzhou
and Huizhou would dare to hire you?

03:13.310 --> 03:14.360
I'd like to see

03:14.360 --> 03:16.520
how you'd survive then!

03:17.520 --> 03:19.560
Zhen, Zhen...

03:19.750 --> 03:21.240
I was wrong.

03:22.310 --> 03:25.190
For your Aunt Chunhua's sake,

03:25.630 --> 03:27.230
please forgive me this time.

03:27.400 --> 03:29.710
Give me a chance
to turn over a new leaf...

03:31.710 --> 03:32.750
Drag him away!

03:32.750 --> 03:33.470
Understood!

03:33.470 --> 03:35.400
Take him straight back to Huizhou.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.960
Zhen... Zhen!

03:38.820 --> 03:41.550
You're literally a disgrace
to the Sixth Branch!

03:43.910 --> 03:45.560
Zhen, calm down.

03:46.000 --> 03:48.100
He should have learned his lesson
after this beating.

03:48.100 --> 03:50.100
Zhengshen, look at this house!

03:51.590 --> 03:53.280
It just serves him right!

03:54.910 --> 03:55.470
No.

03:55.910 --> 03:56.800
Zhengshen,

03:57.520 --> 03:58.920
you must sell this house.

03:59.680 --> 04:01.870
Firstly, it's to fill the hole
left by the raw lacquer.

04:01.870 --> 04:02.680
Secondly,

04:03.000 --> 04:05.530
it's to deprive him
of his fallback in Suzhou.

04:06.590 --> 04:08.120
You are indeed thoughtful.

04:08.680 --> 04:11.520
Also, be careful when handling this.

04:11.870 --> 04:13.930
After all, it involves Aunt Chunhua.

04:13.960 --> 04:16.120
Don't let anyone in the main family know.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.510
I got it. Don't worry.

04:21.920 --> 04:23.040
Chunhua!

04:24.600 --> 04:26.000
I was wrong.

04:26.390 --> 04:27.800
I really know my mistake!

04:27.800 --> 04:28.750
I was wrong!

04:47.200 --> 04:47.930
Decai.

04:54.430 --> 04:56.700
Let bygones be bygones.

04:57.950 --> 05:00.270
I will be satisfied as long as you

05:00.830 --> 05:02.310
treat Run well from now on.

05:07.800 --> 05:09.600
With a wife like this,

05:10.580 --> 05:12.440
what more could a husband ask for?

05:13.560 --> 05:14.240
Chunhua.

05:15.830 --> 05:16.510
I

05:17.070 --> 05:17.870
will head back

05:18.950 --> 05:20.600
to the Li's Residence this afternoon.

05:20.600 --> 05:21.950
I'll tell Aunt Rujun

05:22.430 --> 05:25.690
that I want to resign from all my duties
at the ink workshop.

05:26.390 --> 05:27.720
I'll come back and focus

05:29.000 --> 05:30.750
entirely on keeping you and Run company.

05:30.750 --> 05:31.750
I-Is that good?

05:37.310 --> 05:38.710
Commuting back and forth

05:38.750 --> 05:40.070
is indeed exhausting.

05:40.630 --> 05:42.310
Quitting your job at the ink workshop

05:42.310 --> 05:44.190
might not be a bad thing.

05:46.120 --> 05:48.870
However, with the supply
of raw lacquer being cut off,

05:48.870 --> 05:51.150
those merchants
who have bought your raw lacquer

05:51.150 --> 05:53.680
will probably come after you
for their money.

05:56.870 --> 05:57.600
Chunhua,

05:58.390 --> 05:59.190
don't worry.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.950
I have already

06:01.950 --> 06:03.210
resolved this matter.

06:04.600 --> 06:06.330
Where did you get so much money?

06:07.720 --> 06:09.680
Chunhua, I...

06:10.680 --> 06:14.430
previously bought a large house in Suzhou.

06:15.280 --> 06:17.640
I wanted to give you a surprise.

06:18.070 --> 06:20.270
But who would have anticipated this...

06:21.160 --> 06:22.240
Now,

06:22.630 --> 06:23.870
I might as well sell it

06:24.390 --> 06:26.270
just to cover this deficit.

06:29.190 --> 06:30.510
That's good then.

06:34.480 --> 06:35.070
Father,

06:35.430 --> 06:36.630
where are you going?

06:36.870 --> 06:37.750
To find Li Zhen

06:37.830 --> 06:38.630
and settle the score with her!

06:38.630 --> 06:41.750
No, wait.
What do you want to find Zhen for?

06:42.070 --> 06:43.159
Don't you know?

06:43.400 --> 06:45.310
She fired your uncle.

06:45.340 --> 06:47.950
Isn't that like a slap in the face
to our Sixth Branch?

06:47.950 --> 06:48.190
No.

06:48.190 --> 06:48.990
Wait, Father!

06:49.159 --> 06:51.620
There might be some misunderstanding here.

06:51.630 --> 06:52.680
What misunderstanding?

06:52.680 --> 06:54.920
What misunderstanding
could there possibly be? Tell me.

06:54.920 --> 06:55.560
Get out of the way.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.820
If you speak up for her,

06:56.830 --> 06:58.270
I'll break your legs with my cane!

06:58.270 --> 06:58.800
No,

06:59.120 --> 07:01.480
it was clearly Uncle who betrayed Aunt!

07:01.480 --> 07:03.240
Li Decai resold
the ink workshop's raw lacquer secretly,

07:03.240 --> 07:04.870
and he even kept a mistress in Suzhou.

07:04.870 --> 07:06.130
They even have a child!

07:06.390 --> 07:07.120
Impossible!

07:07.360 --> 07:08.310
Absolutely impossible!

07:08.310 --> 07:09.510
Don't talk nonsense.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.630
How is it impossible?

07:10.630 --> 07:12.830
I went to Suzhou and found it out myself.

07:13.240 --> 07:13.950
For real?

07:14.620 --> 07:16.120
For real! Would I lie to you?

07:16.120 --> 07:17.750
Have a seat. I'll explain it in detail.

07:17.750 --> 07:18.360
Sit down.

07:20.160 --> 07:22.750
That ungrateful Li Decai.

07:23.380 --> 07:25.300
I'll break his legs with my cane!

07:25.390 --> 07:26.650
Please sit down first.

07:33.390 --> 07:34.680
Tell me about it!

07:35.280 --> 07:38.580
Aunt knew about Li Decai's mistress
long ago.

07:39.390 --> 07:40.870
It was only for Run's sake

07:40.950 --> 07:43.000
that she had to keep up appearances.

07:43.040 --> 07:46.000
If you go out
and make this known to everyone,

07:46.159 --> 07:47.820
how could Aunt bear the shame?

07:51.720 --> 07:53.360
Father, don't worry.

07:53.800 --> 07:55.909
Zhen handled this matter perfectly.

07:56.270 --> 07:57.800
She even cut off Li Decai's way out

07:57.800 --> 07:58.830
in Suzhou.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.390
Then why didn't that girl, Li Zhen,

08:01.390 --> 08:03.920
tell me the truth?

08:05.040 --> 08:06.600
Zhen has just taken over the ink workshop,

08:06.600 --> 08:08.230
and many people are
having issues with that.

08:08.230 --> 08:09.680
If she rashly told you

08:10.030 --> 08:11.270
that Uncle resold raw lacquer,

08:11.270 --> 08:12.630
and Aunt cooked the books for him,

08:12.630 --> 08:13.890
would you believe her?

08:14.190 --> 08:15.640
Not only would you not believe her,

08:15.640 --> 08:16.720
but you would also think

08:16.720 --> 08:18.670
she was sowing discord
in our Sixth Branch.

08:18.670 --> 08:20.480
Well... There's solid evidence.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.870
Why wouldn't I believe it?

08:21.870 --> 08:23.430
Even if you believed it,

08:23.630 --> 08:24.800
given your temperament,

08:24.800 --> 08:26.600
you'd definitely take Li Decai to court.

08:26.600 --> 08:28.120
If it caused a stir,

08:28.480 --> 08:30.190
it would only humiliate Aunt,

08:30.360 --> 08:31.620
leave Run fatherless,

08:31.920 --> 08:33.840
and make our Sixth Branch a laughingstock.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.030
Then our Sixth Branch

08:35.030 --> 08:37.030
would inevitably resent Zhen,

08:37.120 --> 08:39.250
and the discord between us would grow.

08:39.340 --> 08:41.140
This would be bad for Li Ink, too.

08:43.840 --> 08:44.480
Father,

08:45.390 --> 08:46.600
in every sense,

08:46.750 --> 08:49.360
Zhen did everything for the Li family.

08:52.320 --> 08:54.480
Fine... I see.

08:55.480 --> 08:56.940
Go mind your own business.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.600
You're not going?

08:59.040 --> 09:00.000
Why would I go?

09:00.000 --> 09:00.910
I'll cool off here for a while.

09:00.910 --> 09:02.910
Go ahead... Go do what you need to do.

09:03.000 --> 09:03.550
Okay.

09:06.620 --> 09:07.950
I'll pour you some tea.

09:09.910 --> 09:11.600
That bastard,

09:12.600 --> 09:14.030
Li Decai.

09:17.630 --> 09:18.240
Hold it well.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.120
Put it outside.

09:18.450 --> 09:27.730
[Li Ink]

09:22.250 --> 09:23.270
Miss Li Zhen,

09:24.600 --> 09:26.320
the ink workshop's lacquer-soot ink orders

09:26.320 --> 09:27.780
are mostly delivered now.

09:28.270 --> 09:31.330
And with the raw lacquer
transported back from Suzhou,

09:31.440 --> 09:35.040
it's enough for our ink workshop
to finish the rest of the orders.

09:35.080 --> 09:38.080
You truly surpass your predecessors.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.840
I'm flattered, Manager Shao.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.440
I've finally fulfilled

09:41.440 --> 09:43.440
Sixth Grandfather's entrustment.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.660
I'll get back to work then.

09:47.550 --> 09:48.240
Take it slow.

09:48.240 --> 09:48.960
Be careful.

10:19.790 --> 10:22.650
The Sixth Branch owes you a favor,
and I'll repay it.

10:48.080 --> 10:48.960
Grandfather,

10:49.720 --> 10:51.050
it's already midnight.

10:51.240 --> 10:52.480
Why are you still up?

10:54.320 --> 10:55.450
I can't fall asleep.

10:56.550 --> 10:57.480
So I might as well

10:57.960 --> 10:59.160
roll some lamp wicks.

11:05.790 --> 11:08.910
Nice, I haven't done this in a while.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.520
Let me roll them with you, Grandfather.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.140
You may go to sleep.

11:19.550 --> 11:20.360
It's fine.

11:21.550 --> 11:23.670
Grandfather, you can't sleep
so late at night

11:23.670 --> 11:28.000
because you worry about Sixth Grandfather's
safety in the mountains, right?

11:30.510 --> 11:32.150
Aunt Chunhua told me

11:32.480 --> 11:33.870
that when Sixth Grandfather was young,

11:33.870 --> 11:36.000
he was in charge of pine wood for Li Ink.

11:36.000 --> 11:38.600
He's used to braving the elements
in the mountains.

11:38.600 --> 11:40.400
You don't need to worry too much.

11:41.360 --> 11:43.360
That was decades ago.

11:44.600 --> 11:45.600
Back then,

11:46.030 --> 11:46.910
he was young,

11:47.150 --> 11:48.150
strong,

11:49.030 --> 11:50.760
and not afraid of any hardship.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.360
I remember

11:54.360 --> 11:56.150
when I was your age,

11:59.820 --> 12:03.240
the Li family had lost the right
to offer Tribute Ink for a long time.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.700
Our family was declining.

12:05.440 --> 12:08.480
We even sold our own pine yard

12:09.030 --> 12:11.430
and couldn't afford good pine from others.

12:12.510 --> 12:13.840
Your Sixth Grandfather

12:14.600 --> 12:15.750
took some men

12:17.000 --> 12:18.240
into the mountains

12:19.080 --> 12:20.080
to find pine wood.

12:25.750 --> 12:26.870
As a result,

12:28.080 --> 12:30.280
as soon as they went into the mountains,

12:30.870 --> 12:33.120
they encountered a fierce tiger.

12:35.120 --> 12:36.720
He fought against this tiger

12:37.320 --> 12:39.000
for several rounds

12:41.390 --> 12:42.670
and lured the tiger

12:43.550 --> 12:45.390
into a hollow.

12:46.840 --> 12:49.150
Then he shot it dead with a single arrow.

12:50.000 --> 12:51.400
The tiger's gallbladder

12:52.240 --> 12:55.600
was used to make medicinal wine
for your great-grandfather.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.910
The tiger skin was sold

12:57.860 --> 12:59.390
to expand the ink workshop.

13:01.630 --> 13:03.360
I got a tiger paw,

13:04.670 --> 13:06.200
treated it like a treasure,

13:07.630 --> 13:08.910
and kept it in my room.

13:12.670 --> 13:14.600
It wasn't until after I got married

13:15.390 --> 13:16.520
that I threw it away.

13:19.150 --> 13:22.350
Sixth Grandfather kept
a tiger tooth for himself, right?

13:24.150 --> 13:25.360
I knew it.

13:25.510 --> 13:26.510
I remember when I was little,

13:26.510 --> 13:28.120
Aunt Chunhua and I once

13:28.270 --> 13:30.530
sneaked into Sixth Grandfather's study

13:30.840 --> 13:34.030
and saw a huge tooth hanging on the wall.

13:34.030 --> 13:35.670
It terrified us back then.

13:36.670 --> 13:39.360
When your Sixth Grandfather was young,
he would sleep

13:39.360 --> 13:40.870
with that tiger tooth

13:41.720 --> 13:43.200
under his pillow

13:43.390 --> 13:44.360
to feel at ease.

13:46.790 --> 13:47.960
No wonder.

13:48.080 --> 13:50.870
I begged Sixth Grandfather
for months back then,

13:51.000 --> 13:53.660
but he wouldn't let me
play with it even for a day.

13:54.200 --> 13:57.080
Your Sixth Grandfather said
that the tiger tooth

13:57.630 --> 13:58.960
bore witness to the time

14:00.080 --> 14:02.960
when he saved Li Ink like a hero,

14:04.480 --> 14:06.030
relying on that tiger skin

14:06.550 --> 14:10.080
to revive Li Ink from the brink
of collapse step by step.

14:10.600 --> 14:12.080
Your Sixth Grandfather,

14:13.390 --> 14:16.520
your Seventh Grandfather,
whom you've never met, and I,

14:17.000 --> 14:18.080
the three of us

14:19.150 --> 14:21.030
worked hard together.

14:23.720 --> 14:25.120
I managed the ink making.

14:26.720 --> 14:29.320
Your Sixth Grandfather
managed the pine yard.

14:29.630 --> 14:33.090
Your Seventh Grandfather
supervised the whole ink workshop.

14:33.120 --> 14:35.050
After a few years of such struggle,

14:36.000 --> 14:38.800
we finally regained
the right to make Tribute Ink.

14:47.670 --> 14:48.750
When you get old,

14:50.320 --> 14:51.850
you just love to reminisce.

14:52.630 --> 14:53.960
It's embarrassing.

14:59.390 --> 15:00.670
Su Shi wrote,

15:01.240 --> 15:03.630
"Rejuvenated, my fiery zeal I display,

15:04.200 --> 15:07.390
On left hand leash, a yellow hound;
on right hand wrist, a falcon grey.

15:07.390 --> 15:11.200
A thousand silk-capped,
sable-coated horsemen sweep."

15:12.000 --> 15:13.240
My Sixth Grandfather went

15:13.240 --> 15:16.040
into the mountains
just with this resolve, right?

15:16.960 --> 15:18.030
I've made up my mind.

15:18.030 --> 15:19.480
When Sixth Grandfather returns,

15:19.480 --> 15:21.910
I will give him an ink stick made by me.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.200
I'll name it

15:23.510 --> 15:25.390
"Fiery Zeal."

15:33.530 --> 15:34.840
Guys, keep it up!

15:34.870 --> 15:36.270
-Okay!
-Okay!

15:51.720 --> 15:55.000
Sixth Master, the weather
in the mountains is unpredictable.

15:55.000 --> 15:55.720
Look,

15:58.200 --> 16:00.630
the scales on this pine cone
have closed up.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.840
I'm afraid it's going to rain soon.

16:02.840 --> 16:04.000
Once it rains,

16:04.030 --> 16:05.790
the whole valley will flood.

16:07.890 --> 16:10.480
How about we take a detour back?

16:13.120 --> 16:13.840
No way.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.770
Taking a detour will waste even more time.

16:17.580 --> 16:18.840
The date for the Tribute Ink is near.

16:18.840 --> 16:21.570
We must hurry up
and transport the pine wood back.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.270
But this is way too dangerous.

16:23.270 --> 16:23.750
No.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.360
Hurry up! Faster!

16:26.510 --> 16:27.600
Hold on tight!

16:45.690 --> 16:46.490
Mother,

16:47.030 --> 16:48.480
you've been standing here
for quite a while.

16:48.480 --> 16:50.870
How about you go sit over there
and rest while waiting?

16:50.870 --> 16:51.630
I'll keep waiting.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.840
Listen to me, Mother.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.720
You can't keep standing.

16:55.670 --> 16:56.270
Come on.

16:56.630 --> 16:58.030
Why didn't Zhen come?

16:58.360 --> 17:01.910
She and Master Qi
went to deal with the ink merchants.

17:01.910 --> 17:03.840
They will be back a bit later.

17:21.000 --> 17:22.260
They're back, Mother.

17:22.609 --> 17:23.410
Get up.

17:24.920 --> 17:25.849
There they come.

17:46.400 --> 17:47.400
Eighth Master Li,

17:47.440 --> 17:48.830
something bad happened.

17:48.830 --> 17:49.690
Where is Jinhe?

19:01.750 --> 19:03.070
What on earth happened?

19:03.070 --> 19:05.030
Didn't you say in the letter the other day
that you found the pine

19:05.030 --> 19:06.110
and started the logging?

19:06.110 --> 19:06.750
But Sixth Master Li...

19:06.750 --> 19:08.210
The water rose in the rain.

19:09.510 --> 19:11.640
Sixth Master refused to take a detour.

19:11.640 --> 19:14.750
He accidentally fell into the river
while transporting the pine wood.

19:14.750 --> 19:16.310
We spent half a day

19:16.310 --> 19:18.310
finding his body downstream.

19:19.920 --> 19:20.720
Grandfather,

19:22.220 --> 19:23.540
what was going on?

19:24.270 --> 19:26.200
How could this happen so suddenly?

19:54.240 --> 19:55.440
Sixth Grandfather.

19:58.310 --> 19:59.510
Sixth Grandfather.

20:00.350 --> 20:02.240
Zhen.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.680
Your...

20:05.550 --> 20:08.720
Your Sixth Grandfather...

20:23.350 --> 20:24.770
Encoffin!

20:55.440 --> 20:56.030
Father,

20:57.270 --> 20:59.330
this is Mother's birthday inkstick.

21:00.750 --> 21:04.310
When you get there, talk to her more.

21:04.750 --> 21:06.410
Don't keep it all to yourself.

21:09.330 --> 21:11.760
[April 28, the 8th Year
of Hongzhi's Reign, made by Zhu Lan.]

21:18.760 --> 21:20.700
[Sincerity Ink]

21:21.110 --> 21:23.070
Jinhe,

21:24.310 --> 21:25.830
why did you...

21:39.110 --> 21:39.960
Grandfather.

22:13.400 --> 22:14.530
Sixth Grandfather,

22:16.510 --> 22:17.920
rest in peace.

22:36.680 --> 22:38.590
Seal the coffin!

22:38.800 --> 22:41.150
Father!

22:41.480 --> 22:42.590
Kneel!

22:42.610 --> 22:44.930
Father!

22:49.510 --> 22:51.880
-Father...
-Father...

22:52.110 --> 22:52.800
Mother!

22:52.830 --> 22:53.880
Mother! Mother!

22:53.880 --> 22:55.400
-Seventh Grandmother.
-Rujun.

22:55.400 --> 22:56.200
Mother, what's wrong?

22:56.200 --> 22:57.590
-Seventh Grandmother!
-Seventh Grandmother!

22:57.590 --> 22:59.030
-Seventh Grandmother!
-Seventh Grandmother!

22:59.030 --> 23:00.230
-Old Madam!
-Mother!

23:00.330 --> 23:02.570
Go get a physician! Now!

23:03.870 --> 23:05.730
-Seventh Grandmother.
-Mother.

23:12.510 --> 23:13.400
Dr. Gu,

23:14.160 --> 23:16.220
how is my Seventh Grandmother doing?

23:19.240 --> 23:21.790
Seventh Old Madam is already
advanced in age.

23:23.110 --> 23:25.040
And she also has a chronic illness.

23:25.500 --> 23:28.550
The Sixth Master Li's incident
happened too suddenly.

23:28.550 --> 23:30.720
That the Old Madam has held on

23:31.030 --> 23:32.200
until now

23:32.350 --> 23:33.880
is already a miracle.

23:37.000 --> 23:39.920
Dr. Gu, please prescribe medicine
for my mother quickly.

23:39.920 --> 23:42.200
Okay, I will write
a prescription right away.

23:42.200 --> 23:44.730
Decoct it immediately
and take three continuous doses.

23:44.730 --> 23:46.720
There may still be hope
for her to wake up.

23:46.720 --> 23:47.790
Hope?

23:48.400 --> 23:49.680
How sure are you?

23:50.830 --> 23:52.440
If my mother doesn't wake up,

23:52.550 --> 23:53.550
what will happen?

23:53.590 --> 23:54.270
Zhengshen,

23:54.270 --> 23:55.400
go get the medicine.

23:55.850 --> 23:57.130
Do not waste any time.

23:57.160 --> 23:57.660
Yes.

24:05.000 --> 24:05.790
Mother,

24:06.640 --> 24:08.160
you must get better soon.

24:23.790 --> 24:24.590
Zhen,

24:25.750 --> 24:28.200
go call everyone to the main hall.

24:29.340 --> 24:31.340
Mother has left words for everyone.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.450
Understood.

24:35.140 --> 24:37.310
A few days ago,
when Zhen came to the ink workshop,

24:37.310 --> 24:39.000
Mother left this letter.

24:39.170 --> 24:41.590
She also invited the Literary Association
to bear witness in person,

24:41.590 --> 24:42.920
just in case.

24:46.000 --> 24:46.960
On the letter

24:48.000 --> 24:50.260
is the seal of the Literary Association.

24:50.350 --> 24:51.440
Please take a look.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.510
Logically,

24:59.030 --> 25:01.690
Jingdong should be the one
reading this letter.

25:02.070 --> 25:05.160
Today, let Huang Ying read it
in place of Jingdong.

25:10.070 --> 25:11.000
Sister-in-law.

25:41.440 --> 25:44.000
The testator, Wang Rujun of the Li family.

25:44.880 --> 25:47.960
I am the wife of Li Jintai.

25:48.480 --> 25:51.130
Recently, I feel
that my time is drawing to an end.

25:51.130 --> 25:53.020
While I am still lucid,

25:53.160 --> 25:56.560
I'd like to leave this testament
to instruct my descendants.

25:56.790 --> 25:58.830
Blessed by our ancestors,

25:58.880 --> 26:01.890
I have fortunately managed the entire clan
for several years.

26:01.890 --> 26:04.480
However,
the decline of Li Ink is hard to reverse.

26:04.480 --> 26:05.880
The family's prosperity

26:06.270 --> 26:09.000
and the ancestors' glory
have yet to be restored.

26:09.680 --> 26:11.960
I feel deep regret

26:12.200 --> 26:15.270
and will not rest in peace
in the netherworld.

26:15.550 --> 26:17.510
Therefore, I leave these instructions.

26:17.510 --> 26:21.000
I hope you will strictly follow them,

26:21.070 --> 26:22.640
with no violations.

26:22.750 --> 26:26.960
The Seventh Branch of the Li family
has few successors and has suffered a lot.

26:26.960 --> 26:28.880
With only a young child,

26:28.880 --> 26:30.680
they cannot bear the heavy responsibility.

26:30.680 --> 26:33.460
Besides, my brother of the Sixth Branch
is long in the tooth.

26:33.460 --> 26:35.670
My eldest nephew, Jingdong, is ill.

26:35.860 --> 26:39.200
My eldest grandson, Zhengshen,
knows little about ink-making.

26:39.200 --> 26:41.550
Fortunately, Li Zhen,
my granddaughter of the Eighth Branch,

26:41.550 --> 26:44.350
has excellent talent in ink-making.

26:44.440 --> 26:47.510
Moreover, she is loyal, kind,
and hardworking.

26:48.040 --> 26:49.770
After careful consideration,

26:50.440 --> 26:52.030
if anything happens to me,

26:52.350 --> 26:54.070
the Li family's property,

26:54.160 --> 26:55.790
including the ink workshop,

26:56.000 --> 26:57.330
will be temporarily...

26:59.750 --> 27:02.160
Will be temporarily managed
by Li Zhen of the Eighth Branch

27:02.160 --> 27:04.020
to make the ink workshop flourish

27:04.510 --> 27:06.440
and restore our ancestors' glory.

27:07.110 --> 27:08.370
I've made my decision.

27:08.750 --> 27:09.720
No one in the clan

27:10.270 --> 27:11.480
shall object.

27:13.110 --> 27:14.750
How is it possible?

27:30.000 --> 27:33.590
Leaving the family property
to this girl from the Eighth Branch,

27:33.590 --> 27:35.270
is Mother muddle-headed?

27:38.880 --> 27:41.010
Mother wrote the letter in front of me.

27:41.030 --> 27:42.630
How could there be a mistake?

27:43.720 --> 27:45.790
Eldest Young Lady, do you mean

27:45.970 --> 27:47.490
that from now on,
Miss Li Zhen can officially

27:47.490 --> 27:48.790
take charge of the Li Ink Workshop?

27:48.790 --> 27:49.640
Yes.

27:50.400 --> 27:53.160
Let her take charge of Li Ink?
On what grounds?

27:53.310 --> 27:56.480
Not to mention that the Eighth Branch
has long been expelled from the clan,

27:56.480 --> 27:58.400
even if they were still in the clan,

27:58.400 --> 28:01.480
Zhengyou'd still be the direct descendant
of the Li family's heir bloodline.

28:01.480 --> 28:02.590
No matter what,

28:02.750 --> 28:04.240
Benchang should be
the ink workshop's acting manager

28:04.240 --> 28:06.500
and raise Zhengyou until he comes of age.

28:06.880 --> 28:08.750
How could it be her turn?

28:12.030 --> 28:13.000
Eldest Aunt,

28:14.400 --> 28:15.530
I am deeply grateful

28:15.920 --> 28:17.920
for how highly Seventh Grandmother

28:18.480 --> 28:19.830
thinks of me.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.920
But with Uncle Jingdong, Eldest Aunt,

28:22.920 --> 28:24.650
and Third Aunt in the Li family,

28:24.960 --> 28:27.750
I can help out
at the ink workshop for a few days,

28:28.240 --> 28:31.160
but I am not qualified to be the manager.

28:31.680 --> 28:32.640
Eldest Aunt,

28:34.070 --> 28:36.200
I cannot shoulder the responsibility

28:37.350 --> 28:39.210
of taking charge of the Li family.

28:45.160 --> 28:46.160
Third Brother...

28:47.240 --> 28:49.310
Say something, Third Brother.

28:49.950 --> 28:51.300
Mother wants to hand over the Li family

28:51.300 --> 28:52.680
to that girl from the Eighth Branch.

28:52.680 --> 28:54.880
Please say something, Third Brother.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.680
Zhen,

28:57.440 --> 28:58.720
it may seem abrupt,

29:00.000 --> 29:01.590
but it is my mother's wish.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.760
You don't have to agree right away.

29:08.030 --> 29:10.480
You can go back
and take your time to think it over.

29:10.480 --> 29:13.480
But I hope you can look after the workshop

29:14.510 --> 29:16.200
while you consider it.

29:17.720 --> 29:19.070
Can you promise me that?

29:21.200 --> 29:22.400
Yes, Miss Li Zhen.

29:22.550 --> 29:24.120
The Li family has suffered such a tragedy.

29:24.120 --> 29:25.720
The ink workshop can't be left unattended.

29:25.720 --> 29:27.580
Please think twice, Miss Li Zhen.

29:33.070 --> 29:33.830
Take it.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.790
Third Brother, say something fair.

29:39.790 --> 29:41.680
You must stand up
for the Seventh Branch, Third Brother!

29:41.680 --> 29:43.750
Jiangyue, stop making a scene.

29:44.270 --> 29:46.550
Jingdong can't take any more stress.

29:47.400 --> 29:48.510
I'm making a scene?

29:51.240 --> 29:52.590
Have you all forgotten?

29:53.880 --> 29:57.000
Who brought the Li family
to such a desperate state?

29:57.880 --> 30:01.140
They have committed grave sins.
How can she be the manager?

30:03.030 --> 30:04.550
Even if you accept her

30:05.440 --> 30:07.830
as a manager, I will never accept it!

30:54.240 --> 30:55.500
Seventh Grandmother,

30:56.830 --> 30:57.750
I know

30:59.630 --> 31:01.160
you are just asleep.

31:01.590 --> 31:04.270
You can definitely hear me, right?

31:04.920 --> 31:06.070
Don't be afraid.

31:07.300 --> 31:09.100
I am staying right here with you.

31:10.750 --> 31:12.480
You will surely wake up.

31:15.550 --> 31:17.590
How about I sing a song for you?

31:20.470 --> 31:23.780
♪ Step on the fire ♪

31:22.270 --> 31:30.870
[The melody is inspired by a folk song
in Huizhou, "Rice and Wheat Grinding."]

31:24.000 --> 31:27.480
♪ We hold Corn Guozi in our hands ♪

31:27.790 --> 31:31.310
♪ Eat the pork in a bowl ♪

31:31.560 --> 31:39.920
♪ I'm living a life of bliss, like a god ♪

31:44.620 --> 31:46.100
Seventh Grandmother,

31:48.510 --> 31:50.400
please wake up.

31:53.200 --> 31:56.200
Didn't you promise me before?

31:57.400 --> 31:58.240
You said

31:58.720 --> 32:01.510
that I only needed to manage
the New Li Ink Workshop well.

32:01.510 --> 32:03.360
But you broke your word.

32:05.160 --> 32:06.830
Now you've thrown this whole mess

32:06.830 --> 32:08.550
all to me.

32:10.000 --> 32:11.960
What am I supposed to do?

32:16.230 --> 32:17.490
Seventh Grandmother.

32:24.640 --> 32:27.440
Please wake up, Seventh Grandmother.

32:32.030 --> 32:33.030
Let's

32:33.640 --> 32:36.110
inspect all the workshops today.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.460
What's this smell?

33:04.480 --> 33:06.070
Miss Li Zhen, Miss Li Zhen.

33:06.190 --> 33:07.620
Emergency.

33:07.640 --> 33:09.920
Manager Shao, don't panic. Speak slowly.

33:09.920 --> 33:13.480
The medicinal ingredients prepared
for making pine soot ink have all spoiled.

33:13.480 --> 33:14.480
How could this be?

33:14.480 --> 33:16.350
These medicinal ingredients are
exceptionally precious.

33:16.350 --> 33:18.510
Master put in a lot of effort to get them

33:18.550 --> 33:20.200
for the Tribute Ink selection.

33:20.200 --> 33:22.030
They have always been
personally kept by Master.

33:22.030 --> 33:24.240
They should have been aired out
every few days.

33:24.240 --> 33:26.880
Probably because of
the Sixth Master's incident lately,

33:26.880 --> 33:28.400
Master failed to properly handle
and store them,

33:28.400 --> 33:29.720
causing them to spoil.

33:31.070 --> 33:33.130
Does Uncle Jingdong know about this?

33:33.960 --> 33:35.760
He probably still doesn't know.

33:36.550 --> 33:40.030
Okay, send someone to repurchase
the medicinal ingredients right away.

33:40.030 --> 33:41.400
The Tribute Ink selection is approaching.

33:41.400 --> 33:43.400
And these medicinal ingredients are
so precious.

33:43.400 --> 33:45.960
I'm afraid we can't
get them ready anytime soon.

33:45.960 --> 33:47.240
No matter how hard it is,
we must buy them.

33:47.240 --> 33:49.350
If necessary, just pay extra.

33:49.590 --> 33:50.440
I believe,

33:50.510 --> 33:52.970
with a hefty reward,
we can surely find some.

33:53.000 --> 33:55.480
Okay, I'll have someone
arrange it immediately.

33:55.480 --> 33:56.350
Manager Shao.

33:56.920 --> 34:00.070
Remember, keep this secret
from everyone else,

34:00.160 --> 34:01.480
especially Uncle Jingdong.

34:01.480 --> 34:02.210
Understood.

34:44.480 --> 34:45.510
Jingdong.

34:46.190 --> 34:47.280
Stop working on it.

34:48.920 --> 34:51.630
Zhen has successfully recreated

34:52.000 --> 34:53.710
the supreme-grade lampblack

34:54.659 --> 34:56.520
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

35:02.030 --> 35:03.490
What about you, Jingdong?

35:03.550 --> 35:06.360
You complain every day
and make enemies everywhere.

35:06.360 --> 35:07.890
You changed a long time ago.

35:08.970 --> 35:10.300
You're criticizing me?

35:10.360 --> 35:11.320
What about you?

35:12.440 --> 35:14.840
Besides supervising production
in the ink workshop,

35:14.840 --> 35:16.840
have you made a single new ink stick?

35:16.880 --> 35:20.140
When a son is not taught properly,
it is the father's fault!

35:23.000 --> 35:24.060
We're dropping out

35:24.240 --> 35:25.900
of the Tribute Ink selection.

35:27.800 --> 35:30.460
The pine wilt disease broke out
in the pine yard.

35:31.230 --> 35:31.880
Father,

35:33.400 --> 35:35.060
despite the outbreak of pine wilt disease
in the pine yard,

35:35.060 --> 35:37.030
we can go out to look for pines.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.590
Why are we not participating?

35:41.550 --> 35:44.880
Father, do you know how much effort

35:45.480 --> 35:47.630
I've put into this selection?

35:48.150 --> 35:49.400
I don't care.

35:50.030 --> 35:51.280
Anyway, I

35:52.320 --> 35:54.280
will absolutely not quit!

36:02.760 --> 36:05.320
I, Li Jingdong, will set up
my own business.

36:05.320 --> 36:06.670
Let's part ways

36:06.670 --> 36:08.960
so you won't be bothered with me anymore!

36:30.590 --> 36:31.800
Fire!

36:32.360 --> 36:33.480
Miss Li Zhen!

36:33.630 --> 36:35.890
Miss Li Zhen! The ink workshop is on fire!

36:35.960 --> 36:37.420
Where exactly is the fire?

36:37.630 --> 36:39.890
Master's... Master's ink-making room!

36:40.190 --> 36:40.720
Let's go.

36:46.670 --> 36:47.590
Master!

36:49.150 --> 36:50.230
Master!

36:50.440 --> 36:51.110
Doggie!

36:51.110 --> 36:51.670
Hurry!

36:51.710 --> 36:52.190
Hurry!

36:52.230 --> 36:52.840
Water!

36:53.770 --> 36:54.860
Uncle Jingdong!

36:55.000 --> 36:55.960
Uncle Jingdong!

36:55.960 --> 36:56.510
Jing...

36:57.630 --> 36:58.630
Master!

36:58.920 --> 36:59.960
Hurry!

37:00.070 --> 37:02.440
Uncle Jingdong, why are you doing this?

37:02.550 --> 37:04.150
If anything happens to you,

37:04.150 --> 37:05.230
what will everyone else do?

37:05.230 --> 37:07.160
Come out quickly, Uncle Jingdong!

37:08.400 --> 37:09.670
Hurry! Water!

37:10.110 --> 37:11.230
Uncle Jingdong!

37:11.250 --> 37:12.040
Master!

37:12.360 --> 37:13.550
You don't have to go to such lengths!

37:13.550 --> 37:14.550
It doesn't have to come to this!

37:14.550 --> 37:15.030
Hurry!

37:15.880 --> 37:17.880
I am unworthy of it!

37:18.360 --> 37:22.590
I don't deserve to be
a descendant of the Li family.

37:22.610 --> 37:25.570
I've brought shame on the Li family!

37:26.110 --> 37:28.760
I am just like
these medicinal ingredients,

37:29.150 --> 37:30.800
moldy

37:31.480 --> 37:33.320
and useless!

37:33.880 --> 37:34.880
Uncle Jingdong!

37:35.070 --> 37:36.230
Uncle Jingdong!

37:36.660 --> 37:37.260
Zhen!

37:37.280 --> 37:39.110
I'm begging you! Please come out, okay?

37:39.110 --> 37:40.110
-Father!
-Come out quickly!

37:40.110 --> 37:41.190
Uncle Jingdong!

37:41.840 --> 37:42.840
I'm begging you!

37:42.840 --> 37:43.280
Jingdong!

37:43.280 --> 37:44.550
Please come out, okay?

37:44.880 --> 37:46.030
Jingdong! Zhen!

37:46.030 --> 37:47.110
Don't come any closer!

37:47.110 --> 37:47.880
Do you want to die?

37:47.880 --> 37:48.480
Father!

37:48.510 --> 37:50.510
Everyone, stay back!

37:50.710 --> 37:51.400
Third Aunt!

37:51.400 --> 37:52.000
It's dangerous, Huang Ying!

37:52.000 --> 37:53.510
Father, what are you doing?

37:53.510 --> 37:54.840
Don't come closer!

37:55.030 --> 37:57.920
If you do, I'll end my life right now!

37:58.070 --> 37:59.000
Uncle Jingdong,

37:59.190 --> 38:01.150
with the pine wood gone,
we can still use tung oil.

38:01.150 --> 38:03.150
With the medicinal ingredients gone,
we can buy new ones.

38:03.150 --> 38:04.320
Come out quickly!

38:04.360 --> 38:06.800
We can buy new medicinal ingredients.

38:08.070 --> 38:11.030
But I've completely lost my heart.

38:12.000 --> 38:14.190
It's hopeless.

38:14.670 --> 38:16.280
For so many years,

38:16.510 --> 38:19.070
I've racked my brains

38:19.550 --> 38:22.150
and never slacked off for a day!

38:23.030 --> 38:27.000
But in the end, I've accomplished nothing!

38:27.800 --> 38:30.200
I'm no nowhere as good
as either your father

38:31.110 --> 38:33.400
or my Eighth Uncle!

38:34.190 --> 38:38.400
I'm not even as good
as a little girl like you!

38:39.440 --> 38:42.190
I've brought shame on Li Ink!

38:42.720 --> 38:44.330
Go away.

38:44.360 --> 38:45.070
Come out quickly!

38:45.070 --> 38:47.230
Jingdong, come out! Jingdong!

38:51.590 --> 38:55.150
Were it not for me,
my father wouldn't have died.

38:55.510 --> 38:56.760
Uncle Jingdong!

38:57.670 --> 38:59.630
I'm begging you! Please come out!

39:04.700 --> 39:05.550
What should we do?

39:05.550 --> 39:07.670
Please come out.

39:08.150 --> 39:09.210
Move out of the way!

39:09.360 --> 39:10.070
Get up!

39:11.680 --> 39:13.140
-Zhengshen!
-Zhengshen!

39:13.510 --> 39:15.710
-Zhengshen!
-Young Master Zhengshen!

39:15.920 --> 39:17.320
Young Master Zhengshen!

39:24.550 --> 39:25.710
Zhengshen!

39:26.360 --> 39:27.510
Zhengshen!

39:30.000 --> 39:32.000
Fire! He's on fire!

39:32.360 --> 39:33.360
He's on fire!

39:34.280 --> 39:34.920
Put out the fire!

39:34.920 --> 39:35.840
-Put out the fire now!
-Hurry!

39:35.840 --> 39:37.970
Hurry! Go get a physician to save them!

39:39.510 --> 39:40.440
Zhengshen!

39:40.960 --> 39:41.630
Aunt.

39:41.920 --> 39:42.710
Third Aunt!

39:45.760 --> 39:46.480
Zhengshen.

39:46.620 --> 39:47.870
Zhengshen!

39:49.110 --> 39:50.230
Zhengshen!

40:07.590 --> 40:08.320
Zhengshen.

40:08.400 --> 40:09.400
Someone, help!

40:09.960 --> 40:10.360
Come on.

40:10.360 --> 40:11.690
-Be careful!
-Careful!

40:11.960 --> 40:12.630
Hurry!

40:13.030 --> 40:13.800
Help them!

40:14.800 --> 40:15.550
Lend a hand.

40:16.770 --> 40:18.210
Gently, gently.

40:18.550 --> 40:19.030
Master.

40:25.610 --> 40:26.880
Hurry, put out the fire.

40:26.880 --> 40:27.920
Father, Father.

40:30.320 --> 40:31.320
He's still breathing.

40:31.320 --> 40:33.050
Mother, he's still breathing.

40:37.630 --> 40:39.760
Why did you do this?

40:52.710 --> 40:54.240
Li Jingdong, are you crazy?

40:54.840 --> 40:56.960
If you want to die, die alone!

40:57.190 --> 40:59.050
You burned down the ink workshop.

40:59.150 --> 41:02.110
How is everyone else in the Li family
supposed to survive?

41:02.110 --> 41:02.920
Jiangyue.

41:03.150 --> 41:04.150
Stop pretending.

41:04.360 --> 41:05.400
Get up.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.440
If you die,

41:07.880 --> 41:09.000
the Li family will completely

41:09.000 --> 41:10.920
fall into Li Zhen's hands!

41:17.230 --> 41:18.590
How dare you hit me?

41:18.790 --> 41:20.140
Who do you think you are?

41:20.840 --> 41:21.920
Get a hold of yourself!

41:21.920 --> 41:23.720
Jiangyue, stop messing around!

41:24.190 --> 41:26.550
Sister-in-law! I'm her elder!

41:26.550 --> 41:27.880
How dare she hit me?

41:27.880 --> 41:29.590
I am the manager
appointed by Seventh Grandmother!

41:29.590 --> 41:30.890
Why wouldn't I dare to hit you?

41:30.890 --> 41:32.150
Uncle Jingdong is still in a coma,

41:32.150 --> 41:34.480
but you're making a scene here,
not caring at all.

41:34.480 --> 41:35.710
Don't you deserve the hitting?

41:35.710 --> 41:37.360
Are you even part of the Li family?

41:37.360 --> 41:38.280
Manager Shao!

41:39.070 --> 41:40.630
Help me send Jiangyue back.

41:41.360 --> 41:42.110
Enough, Jiangyue.

41:42.110 --> 41:43.030
Young Lady, Young Lady.

41:43.030 --> 41:43.760
Let me go!

41:43.760 --> 41:44.760
Let's go quickly.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.760
Let's go. Let's go.

41:47.120 --> 41:48.330
Zhengshen, hurry.

41:48.360 --> 41:49.490
Carry your dad home.

41:49.510 --> 41:51.040
Don't delay his treatment.

41:51.190 --> 41:52.590
Third Aunt, go home first.

41:52.590 --> 41:53.230
Come on.

41:55.920 --> 41:56.650
Take it slow.

42:01.000 --> 42:02.320
What's wrong

42:02.920 --> 42:04.480
with our Li family?

42:06.630 --> 42:07.480
Eldest Aunt,

42:08.110 --> 42:09.760
I'm still here with the Li family.

42:09.760 --> 42:12.490
Don't worry,
I won't just stand by and do nothing.

42:12.880 --> 42:13.740
I will take over

42:14.400 --> 42:15.360
the Li family.

42:19.150 --> 42:20.030
Zhen.

42:30.230 --> 42:31.960
Sit down, please, Eldest Aunt.

42:32.880 --> 42:34.960
Zhen, you should take some rest, too.

42:35.590 --> 42:38.920
I have to go to the ink workshop
to check the situation again.

42:40.070 --> 42:41.000
Manager Shao!

42:41.440 --> 42:41.960
What's wrong?

42:41.960 --> 42:43.820
Eldest Young Lady, Manager Zhen,

42:44.480 --> 42:45.800
things have gotten much worse.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.470
The fire reached the smoke shed,

42:47.470 --> 42:48.840
and the warehouse was also affected.

42:48.840 --> 42:50.150
We have put out the fire,

42:50.150 --> 42:52.230
yet the goods
we were supposed to deliver inside

42:52.230 --> 42:53.560
were mostly destroyed.

42:55.360 --> 42:56.230
Manager Shao.

42:56.610 --> 42:58.210
When are the delivery dates?

42:58.230 --> 42:59.400
Is there still time to remake them?

42:59.400 --> 43:00.840
Most of them are due soon.

43:00.920 --> 43:02.920
The earliest order is due tomorrow.

43:02.920 --> 43:03.670
Tomorrow?
